  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Have you used a cowash before? Will you try it?</span><br><span>Let's Curl Up with Alldoer!!</span><br><span>Alldoer NewYear Month Sales is On!! Collect your Bundle Fast!!</span><br><span>https://alldoer.com/collections/all</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>How to take care of your curls with Alldoer 🤝✨</span><br><br><span>1. Choose your shampoo wisely: cleansing💆&zwj;♀️</span><br><br><span>Washing your hair is the first and foremost step in any hair care routine, irrespective of its texture. Washing or cleansing ensures that there is no dust, excess oil, dead skin cells, or product buildup on your scalp.</span><br><br><span>Use a clarifying shampoo free of toxic chemicals like sulfates, silicones, alcohol, and parabens that can irritate your scalp. Like Alldoers' gentle clarifying shampoo.</span><br><br><span>2. After shampoo treatment: conditioning and styling🧴</span><br><br><span>The next step is to condition your hair. Conditioning makes sure that your hair's cuticle is sealed and protected against environmental damage.</span><br><br><span>Look for hydrating ingredients such as aloe vera, flaxseed oil, shea butter, and avocado oil so that the ingredients can sink deep into the hair shaft, providing intense hydration to your curls. You can use an Alldoer conditioner, a leave-in conditioner, or a deep conditioning mask to keep your hair hydrated, healthy, and strong.</span><br><br><span>Lastly, apply the best styling gel, such as Alldoer Superhold Jelly, which gives extra bounce to your curls and keeps them defined for 3-5 days.😇😇</span><br><br><span>And Voila !! You have unlocked the perfect luscious curls💃💃</span><br><br><span>Comment below if this was helpful for you and do share it with your curlies ⬇️⬇️😇🤩</span><br><span>.</span><br><span>.</span><br><span>.</span><br><span>.</span><br><span>.</span><br><span>.</s